/* CBS task drawer (shared). Served by CBS - Tasks at GET /webhook/cbs-tasks-ui and loaded by the Job File Tasks panel, so every task
   opens in the same drawer.
   window.CBSTask.open(task, opts)   task: {key, src, id, job, title, category, status, note, note_by, note_date, assignee, due,
                                           desc, checklist, files, link, al, auto, reft, grp, overdue}
                                     opts: {onChange(), openRecord()}
   Details: opts.details(box, task) fills a Details section (the requirement's own fields), returns a clean-up function or false.
   Dismiss for roll-up reminders (diary to write, RFIs to send...): hidden until the reminder text changes.
   Delete for every job task row; Remove from job for ticked items (enquiry items always, job requirements where opts.removeReq(k) is given).
   Tasks on a job also get Open Job N file (hidden when you are already on that job's file); on that job's file, links back to the same
   job's enquiry or job file are hidden too.
   window.CBSTask.create(opts)       opts: {job, stage, onChange()}  new job task (cbs_job_tasks row).
   Saves: cbs-tasks-act (create, update, status, meta, file, unfile, delete). Files go to SharePoint through cbs-job-files-up
   (Jobs/Job N/<folder>, or Office Tasks for tasks with no job). People for Assigned to come from cbs_workers (GET cbs-people). */
(function(){
